      "raw": "# Grouping and Ranking of Badges",
      "kind": "heading",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "depth": 1,
      "text": "Grouping and Ranking of Badges",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "lines": [
        9,
        9
      ],
      "raw": "You can define badge groups, the rank of the group and the rank of badges even without the group tagging. This enables sorting customers' badge collections and highlighting their achievements.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "You can define badge groups, the rank of the group and the rank of badges even without the group tagging. This enables sorting customers' badge collections and highlighting their achievements.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "lines": [
        11,
        11
      ],
      "raw": "For example, in the below screenshot, Limited Edition badges have a higher priority followed by Monthly challenge badges, Workout badges, and Close your Rings badges. Within each defined group, badges are sorted based on their rank.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "For example, in the below screenshot, Limited Edition badges have a higher priority followed by Monthly challenge badges, Workout badges, and Close your Rings badges. Within each defined group, badges are sorted based on their rank.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
