      "raw": "# Example",
      "kind": "heading",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "depth": 1,
      "text": "Example",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "lines": [
        17,
        17
      ],
      "raw": "Consider three badge groups, Group 1, Group 2 and Group 3 ranked 1, 2, and 3. While creating badges, Badge 1 is tagged with Group 1, Badge 2 is tagged with Group 2, and Badge 3 doesn't have any group tagged but has a badge rank of 1.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Consider three badge groups, Group 1, Group 2 and Group 3 ranked 1, 2, and 3. While creating badges, Badge 1 is tagged with Group 1, Badge 2 is tagged with Group 2, and Badge 3 doesn't have any group tagged but has a badge rank of 1.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "lines": [
        19,
        19
      ],
      "raw": "## Retrieving badges list",
      "kind": "heading",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "Retrieving badges list",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "lines": [
        21,
        21
      ],
      "raw": "In the above scenario, when you retrieve the list of badges available for a customer, the system prioritizes based on the defined groups and badge ranks. Initially, the list is ordered as Badge 1, then Badge 2, and finally Badge 3 (due to the group tag of Badge 3 being null but having a rank).",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "In the above scenario, when you retrieve the list of badges available for a customer, the system prioritizes based on the defined groups and badge ranks. Initially, the list is ordered as Badge 1, then Badge 2, and finally Badge 3 (due to the group tag of Badge 3 being null but having a rank).",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "lines": [
        23,
        23
      ],
      "raw": "## Impact on deleting a group",
      "kind": "heading",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "Impact on deleting a group",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "lines": [
        25,
        25
      ],
      "raw": "If a group is deleted the order of the badges also changes.  For example, if Group 1 is deleted, fetching the badge list will now prioritize Badge 2 first (as it belongs to Group 2), then Badge 3 (due to its rank), and finally Badge 1.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "If a group is deleted the order of the badges also changes.  For example, if Group 1 is deleted, fetching the badge list will now prioritize Badge 2 first (as it belongs to Group 2), then Badge 3 (due to its rank), and finally Badge 1.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "lines": [
        27,
        27
      ],
      "raw": "The sorting of the badges is performed using the sortOn parameter in the [Get customer badge API](https://docs.capillarytech.com/reference/get-badges-for-customer).",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "The sorting of the badges is performed using the sortOn parameter in the Get customer badge API.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": [
        {
          "kind": "absoluteInternalLink",
          "value": "https://docs.capillarytech.com/reference/get-badges-for-customer",
          "line": 27
        }
      ]
    },
