    {
      "i": 13,
      "lines": [
        31,
        33
      ],
      "raw": "* Preference will be given to the groups as per their ranking\n* Within the group, preference will be given to the badges for which badge rank is defined, the rest of the badges with no badge rank will be sorted in default descending order of expired date\n* If badges with no group are defined, they will be sorted in order of badge rank (if defined), followed by default descending order of expired date",
      "kind": "list",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Preference will be given to the groups as per their rankingWithin the group, preference will be given to the badges for which badge rank is defined, the rest of the badges with no badge rank will be sorted in default descending order of expired dateIf badges with no group are defined, they will be sorted in order of badge rank (if defined), followed by default descending order of expired date",
      "attrs": {
        "ordered": "false"
      },
